    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pbdp](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pbdp) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 98.862 depth occurred on Feb 05 2025 67km NW of Akelamo. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 1.6303 longitude 127.1469. It impacted 25314 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
